1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,120
Meet NexusOne Copilot: company knowledge, live data, and support, together.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,960
For employees, managers, HR, finance, IT, admin, and leadership.

3
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,920
One assistant, different permissions.

4
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:16,340
Our server-side authorization layer checks identity, roles, groups, and ownership.

5
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:19,960
Employees get safe denials; authorized leaders get access.

6
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,840
Ask a policy question.

7
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:26,240
Open its citation to review the approved source and its date.

8
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:34,140
Live ticket lookups use approved sources, read-only query checks, scoped rows, and sanitized results.

9
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:39,000
Describe your issue, review the ticket preview, then explicitly approve.

10
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,900
Creation happens only after your confirmation.

11
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,400
Short-term history preserves conversations.

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,980
Personal memory recalls saved details across chats, separately for each user.

13
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:50,880
Injection checks block bypass attempts.

14
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:54,900
Feedback, trace metadata, and evaluation tests help review answers and access decisions.

15
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,980
The workspace also adapts to mobile.

16
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:59,900
One workspace, for every team, with clear controls.

